# ============================================================
# PROJECT: Multi-Tenant Hospital SaaS Platform
# STACK: Next.js (App Router), Node.js, TypeScript, PostgreSQL
# SCOPE: Super Admin Web, Backend API, Shared Auth & Tenancy
# ROLE: Cursor acts as a Senior SaaS Architect & Backend Engineer
# ============================================================

## CORE ARCHITECTURE PRINCIPLE (VERY IMPORTANT)
- This project uses **Next.js as a full-stack framework**.
- Backend APIs and Super Admin frontend live in the SAME codebase.
- They MUST be logically and structurally separated.
- Backend APIs must remain framework-agnostic and reusable by:
  - Web Admin
  - Doctor mobile app
  - Patient mobile app

---

## NEXT.JS RESPONSIBILITIES
Next.js is used for:
1. Super Admin web interface
2. REST API backend
3. Authentication & middleware
4. Server-side security & tenancy enforcement

Do NOT mix UI logic with backend logic.

---

